- `subprocess`
- `os.system`
- `os.popen`
- `socket`
- `requests` (case-sensitive — Python package import name)
- `httpx`
- `urllib`
- `legacy_reference`
- `/home/wali/Desktop/AI BOT/`
- `BINANCE_API_KEY`
- `BINANCE_API_SECRET`
- `time.time(`
- `datetime.now(`
- `datetime.utcnow(`
- `numpy`
