- Any reference to `legacy_reference`, `/home/wali/Desktop/AI BOT`,
  `BINANCE_API_KEY`, `BINANCE_API_SECRET`, or
  `live_trading_enabled = true`.
- Any γ-side observation collector. γ is a separate sub-phase.

